sequenceDiagram
    actor Farmer
    participant Screen as BookEquipmentScreen
    participant Ctrl as BookingController
    participant UC as BookingUseCases
    participant Repo as BookingRepository (Firestore)
    participant DB as Cloud Firestore
    Farmer->>Screen: taps "Continue to Payment"
    Screen->>Ctrl: bookEquipment(...)
    Ctrl->>UC: bookEquipment(...)
    UC->>UC: validate, price (BookingPricing)
    UC->>Repo: create(NewBooking)
    Repo->>DB: transaction: counter + booking document
    UC->>Repo: notify owner
    DB-->>Repo: snapshot (new booking)
    Repo-->>Screen: StreamProvider rebuilds My Bookings instantly
    Ctrl-->>Screen: ActionResult(ref) or error message
